<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney said analyst Peter Treadway downgraded Telefonos de Mexico SA to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- In a report, the analyst said a $40 price target &quot;leaves insufficient upside from year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Said the company's fourth quarter results &quot;could be disappointing.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Stock has major upside potential only after long-distance picture clearer,&quot; the report said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 at 37-1/8 in early U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
